}}The '''Amulet of Will''' is a powerful artifact once used by [[Lord Casterwill]] and alluded to in the [[Eathon's journal|journal]] of [[Eathon Lambert]]. It has become the symbol of the [[Casterwill family]], decorating their artifacts and landmarks. {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}

Legend states that anyone attempting to summon either of the three [[Legendary Titans]], [[Araknos]], [[Behemoth]], or [[Tao]], without bearing the Amulet of Will, will be afflicted by a [[Curse of the Legendary Titans|deadly curse]]. 

The four gemstones on the Amulet of Will represent these Legendary Titans: blue for Tao, green for Behemoth, red for Araknos, as well as a white one for [[Overlos]], the Legendary Titan of Immortality sealed inside the Amulet of Will itself.

